      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4  Propose an edit from each scan",
      "originalText": "4  Propose an edit from each scan",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "detailtrust-22",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 618,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 221,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#24354b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1022,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 10022,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791892185055,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "One shared refiner uses:\ncontext F + that scan’s detail H + its identity.\n\nRun it twice: with detail, and with detail = 0.\nSubtract the second output from the first:\nr = R(F,H,identity) − R(F,0,identity).\nNo detail ⇒ zero edit.\n+ raises a tumour score; − lowers it.",
      "originalText": "One shared refiner uses:\ncontext F + that scan’s detail H + its identity.\n\nRun it twice: with detail, and with detail = 0.\nSubtract the second output from the first:\nr = R(F,H,identity) − R(F,0,identity).\nNo detail ⇒ zero edit.\n+ raises a tumour score; − lowers it.",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
