      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791892185055,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A shared spatial gate reads F, detail, edit,\nmodality identity and availability flags.\n\nAt every voxel, it outputs a weight q (0 to 1).\nSmall q: suppress the edit. Large q: retain it.\nThis weight is not a confidence probability.",
      "originalText": "A shared spatial gate reads F, detail, edit,\nmodality identity and availability flags.\n\nAt every voxel, it outputs a weight q (0 to 1).\nSmall q: suppress the edit. Large q: retain it.\nThis weight is not a confidence probability.",
